{
 "words": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "id": "s1",
   "words": 2,
   "head": "You define what must be true. It builds toward it \u2014 with you",
   "text": "Amplifier Converge"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "id": "s2",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "One person now builds what took a team.",
   "text": "Why now AI does more every month. Old coordination cannot keep pace. Short version one human a team\u2019s output"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "id": "s3",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "Two AI roles you have not met.",
   "text": "The idea One runs for weeks. Many take one piece. You are neither. manager session worker sessions intent steward"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "id": "s4",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "You write two things, both in plain words.",
   "text": "The words Read in a minute. Vision the project when it is right Contracts promises precise enough to check"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "id": "s5",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "The direction is grown, not declared.",
   "text": "How it matures draft locked 1says what it means 2shows right and wrong 3can be checked 4you have agreed"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "id": "s6",
   "words": 17,
   "head": "One text, two audiences.",
   "text": "The through-line Human agreement becomes AI guardrail. a teammate\u2019sproposal the managersession\u2019s identical your word every session obeys"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "id": "s7",
   "words": 18,
   "head": "Your attention, spent only where you are irreplaceable.",
   "text": "Your part Anything else is a defect. define the direction confirm the decisions taste and judgment critical thinking"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "id": "s8",
   "words": 17,
   "head": "Four calls only you can make.",
   "text": "The four calls Ratifya change of direction Committo something irreversible Checkwhat only a person can Prioritiseor stop"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "id": "s9",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "The manager session runs the whole operation.",
   "text": "The operation 1derives work from the gap 2shows you the plan 3launches lanes 4judges by evidence 5writes your brief"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "id": "s10",
   "words": 16,
   "head": "Waiting on you is never the bottleneck.",
   "text": "Its governing strategy Everything that can proceed without you, does. 8 running 2 waiting on you"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "id": "s11",
   "words": 12,
   "head": "Every piece of work ends one of three ways.",
   "text": "Three exits done, with proof stuck, with the cause needs your judgment"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "id": "s12",
   "words": 17,
   "head": "Two places, on laptop or phone.",
   "text": "The app At most five things ever ask for your word. place one Direction place two Operation"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "id": "s13",
   "words": 18,
   "head": "You can do exactly four things.",
   "text": "Four writes The app keeps no data. answer with a word raise or lower priority drop feedback steer"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "id": "s14",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "What this is not.",
   "text": "Boundaries And not autonomy for its own sake. \u00d7an issue tracker \u00d7a dashboard \u00d7notifications \u00d7a code-review tool \u00d7one-shot magic"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "id": "s15",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "Proven pieces, composed \u2014 not rebuilt.",
   "text": "Dependencies One install verified, or it says what\u2019s missing. shared work queue parallel lanes worktrees, multiplexer a lean base"
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "id": "s16",
   "words": 15,
   "head": "A day with it.",
   "text": "In practice 1morning: read the brief 2midday: one decision 3afternoon: it runs 4evening: seen working"
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "id": "s17",
   "words": 14,
   "head": "One line, onto the Amplifier CLI you already have.",
   "text": "Getting started Settle the vision first. Then the contracts. amplifier bundle add git+https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-converge@main#subdirectory=behaviors/converge.yaml --app"
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "id": "s18",
   "words": 19,
   "head": "The return brief.",
   "text": "Recap You set direction and decide. A manager session runs it. Workers return with proof. Locked words bind everyone."
  }
 ],
